<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka Hatton Bank H1 net up 9 pct.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka Hatton Bank H1 net up 9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>    Turnover	  2,887.73     vs	2,210.45</p>
<p>    Net profit	  246.96     vs	  226.54</p>
<p>    Tax provision	76.00     vs	   48.00</p>
<p>NOTE - Results are unaudited. Hatton National Bank Ltd is one of four  private commercial banks listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
